      "right": "275px",
      "text": "לה בצידי הרחבה: <b><big><span class=\"bavli-ref\" data-bavli-ref=\"(דף כא:)\" data-bavli-daf=\"21b\" data-bavli-index=\"0\"></span>מתני'</big></b> <i data-commentator=\"Mishneh Torah, Damages to Property\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Tur\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Shulchan Arukh, Choshen Mishpat\" data-label=\"⚬\"></i>הכלב והגדי שקפצו",
